      "id": "1259268747260042_122115939735384130",
      "date": "2026-07-28",
      "text": "¡Feliz Fiestas Patrias! 🇵🇪\nHoy celebramos con todo el orgullo de ser peruanos. Feliz 28 de julio para todos 🤗\n\n#FelizFiestasPatrias #28DeJulio #Xsell",
      "image_url": "https://scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/759384224_122115939423384130_7042489847403962814_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=127cfc&_nc_ohc=KFP0VCf4J2UQ7kNvwGi-R23&_nc_oc=AdqYztcuH64O7LepxIxp6c6hfYnRrsvLdm9LZ-4_4f4p90DBwM8Ds4O03J4TKB5oDKw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.xx&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=NPLWBzK5B67IWbe2U64WfA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQI7J3rBZ6Ps4M4nwnaWL_ePeJzr6e3yDIICEpuMfyNOdbFBI4WWYk_3-yhN2MDpy7huTGtQgtOXIg&oh=00_AQGY_XmYdLujcKLb7YLXghw6u5eAzy_-4MdXvJRc2OK9AQ&oe=6A8D50CA",
      "permalink": "https://www.facebook.com/122122570719384130/posts/122115939735384130",
